OL,3,GNEWSAMurder trial set after woman died
OL,4,Afrom head injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murdering a woman who died
OL,8,Fat a property in Bracknell.
OL,10,FNatalie Clements, 40, was pronounced
OL,11,Fdead at a home in Birkdale on 15 July.
OL,12,FA post-mortem examination concluded she
OL,13,Fdied from head injuries.
OL,15,FMatthew Wilkie, 48, from the Berkshire
OL,16,Ftown, appeared at Reading Crown Court
OL,17,Fthis week, where he pleaded not guilty
OL,18,Fto one count of murder. He remains in
OL,19,Fcustody.
OL,21,FHis trial is scheduled to start on 11
OL,22,FJanuary 2027.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
